      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would love to be able to text a friend in VRChat and not having to rely on 3rd party platforms like Discord. I think it would definitely be beneficial for standalone users as well as PC users in case your friends are busy in another world. Having to rely on invite and request invite messages in order to communicate with one another is very inconvenient, especially since each invite message takes 30 minutes to update.",
